<title>FRANCE: Pathe 1996 net profit 186 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Pathe 1996 net profit 186 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					 186  vs  proforma loss 509</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		  10  vs		     NA</p>
<p>Earnings before interest,</p>
<p>	 tax, depreciation and</p>
<p>	 amortisation			 514  vs  proforma	195</p>
<p>    Turnover				1,841  vs  proforma    1,093</p>
<p>- of which</p>
<p>	 Television			    87  vs  proforma	 58</p>
<p>	 Film production/distribution   807  vs  proforma	508</p>
<p>	 Cinema theatres		    736  vs  proforma	527</p>
<p>	 &quot;Liberation&quot; newspaper</p>
<p>	    (second half 1996 only)     211  vs		     NA</p>
<p>NOTE - Pathe, the media company created out of the break-up of the Chargeurs holding group last year, gave its results in a statement.</p>
</text>
